cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PubertyNeuroendo-MM: Deep neural network models of hormone-related brain morphology in adolescence"
abstract: >-
  Code for training and interpreting fully connected deep neural networks that
  predict pubertal hormone levels (DHEA, testosterone, and estradiol) from gray
  matter morphology,
  with explainable AI (integrated gradients, layer-wise relevance propagation)
  to identify hormone-related brain regions. Includes synthetic datasets for
  testing the pipeline.
